<translate>
==== AttachmentsProvided ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Defines the hotbar slots added when the item is equipped, and therefore the available {{ll|AttachmentType|attachments}} and attached location on the character for the item occupying the slot. These are defined in <code>ISHotbarAttachDefinition.lua</code>.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
AttachmentsProvided = HolsterLeft;HolsterRight,
</syntaxhighlight>

== Hotbar slot definitions and items == <!--T:3-->

<!--T:4-->
The below table shows a list of hotbar slots (<code>type</code>), its <code>name</code>, <code>animset</code>, and <code>{{ll|AttachmentType|attachments}}</code> it uses, along with the items that currently provide it.
</translate>
